This licence covers only the code in this repository (web/, native/shims/,
native/CMakeLists.txt, test/, tools/).

The build combines it with third-party sources that are fetched, not vendored:

  * mbelib (lwvmobile fork, branch ambe_tones) — ISC.
  * libsndfile 1.2.2 — LGPL-2.1-or-later.
  * dsd-fme (lwvmobile) — mostly ISC, but not entirely:
      src/fec.c                     GPL-3.0-only
      src/rs-12-9.c, src/ezpwd/*    GPL-3.0-or-later
      src/dstar_header.c, fcs.h,
      descramble.h                  GPL-2.0-only

Because those files are linked into it, the resulting dsd-fme-rb.wasm is a
combined work under the GNU General Public License, and redistributing that
binary carries GPL obligations. Note also that GPL-2.0-only and GPL-3.0-only
files coexist upstream in dsd-fme; that is inherited from upstream, not
introduced here. Full source for every component is fetched by
.github/workflows/pages.yml, so the build is reproducible from source.
